{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[SHORT STORY]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play from a third person perspective as a young man whom inherited the family\u2019s wealth, you chose to use some of that money to start a cruise business that mostly caters to engagement parties or bridal parties. However, on this trip you're hosting the event for a bachelorette party. You can choose to interact with the guests while they're aboard your yacht. Or you can simply be the curious host and keep the interaction purely professional. As soon as the guests arrive you'll embark on out to sea and head for paradise island. With both night and day interactions you can choose where to go and whom to talk to:  spontaneous connections, and unforgettable nights. It\u2019s a place where grown-ups let go, unwind, and write their own stories\u2014luxurious, intimate, and just a little bit wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your own route through one playthrough or multiple!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738790/extras/0ce7757f52cac2eb4ca1a9bcaf1d45c8.avif?t=1748705650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738790/extras_big/0ce7757f52cac2eb4ca1a9bcaf1d45c8.avif?t=1748705650 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide which route you would like to take with any of these lovely women.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738790/extras/691ee0a75453f50bd47dc3945bda369e.avif?t=1748705650\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738790/extras_big/691ee0a75453f50bd47dc3945bda369e.avif?t=1748705650 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul 